{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026RVZaUpaGpS1794561363.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港姐冠軍兼「魔音女團」成員宋宛穎早前飛抵韓國進行工作，完成任務後隨即開啟「度假模式」大快朵頤，並於社交網分享一輯餐廳花絮相片及短片，開心發文表示：「出差的快樂，工作結束後就是holiday mode on✨it’s been a while🦀🤤」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"sabrinaxmendes_1794480868_4028718422321238888_54644859 (1).jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rubGuFTQjK1794561377.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>曝光的相片及片段中，宋宛穎打扮清純溫柔，穿上一件白色毛領麻花針織開胸衫，配上棕色長直髮，散發滿滿仙氣。坐在窗邊木桌前的她，面前放有一碗紫菜蟹籽拌飯及熱騰騰的韓式辣湯，而她手中更拿著一塊爆滿鮮橙色蟹膏的醬油蟹。她在鏡頭前一時甜笑舉起醬油蟹打卡，一時又低頭望著誘人蟹膏嘟嘴賣萌，盡顯俏皮可愛一面。雖然美食當前極度吸睛，但網民卻集體「錯晒重點」，完全無視誘人的醬油蟹，將焦點全放在女神的靚樣上，湧入留言區洗版激讚：「還是很想說好美好美😻✨」、「好看愛看💞」、「真係好靚女」。</p><p><p><img alt=\"sabrinaxmendes_1794480868_4028718418915406607_54644859 (1).jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DNpdNOtqcM1794561388.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:56:36.230448+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T06:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T20:20:19.669254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:50:23.343186+00:00","content_hash":"60402e457f5ae8d994f8907f1677ea777a30bcfc7b903ba426e4eedb024cdd98","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:56:36.230448+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}